              "content": "Salesforce redirects the browser here, then we bounce back to the app.\n\nOn denied consent Salesforce redirects with ``error`` and no ``code``,\nso both are optional and the error path is handled explicitly.\n\nReturns:\n    A redirect back to the app with the success or error outcome.",
